z": -0.14, "rz": -0.9, "earn": true, "q": "Our third quarter results exceeded our sales and adjusted earnings per share guidance, and marks encouraging progress in our Consumer First Formula. One year after introducing this strategy, we are seeing our actions translate into results across product, brand, and marketplace.", "a": "Daniel Heaf, chief executive officer of Bath & Body Works, commented", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/701985/000070198526000031/ex991bbwi-20263qearningsre.htm"}, {"d": "2026-08-26", "n": 6.19, "z": 0.55, "rz": -0.39, "earn": true, "q": "Our second-quarter results exceeded our sales and earnings per share guidance. Underlying business trends remain pressured, but we are seeing further evidence that elements of the Consumer First Formula are beginning to work. We delivered sequential improvement in Body Care, stronger AUR on new product innovation, impr…", "a": "Daniel Heaf, chief executive officer of Bath & Body Works, commented", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/701985/000070198526000025/ex991bbwi-20262qearningsre.htm"}, {"d": "2026-05-27", "n": 1.96, "z": -1.4, "rz": 0.06, "earn": true, "q": "Our first-quarter results exceeded guidance, but remain below the standard our brand is capable of delivering. That reality reinforces the urgency with which we are executing the Consumer First Formula. Our efforts to strengthen our hero categories, modernize the brand, and expand our reach are beginning to resonate wi…", "a": "Daniel Heaf, chief executive officer of Bath & Body Works, commented", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/701985/000070198526000012/ex991bbwi-20261qearningsre.htm"}, {"d": "2026-03-04", "n": 0.0, "z": -2.95, "rz": 0.22, "earn": true, "q": "Our fourth quarter results exceeded the guidance we provided. Since launching the Consumer First Formula in the third quarter, we have moved with urgency to accelerate innovation in our hero categories, refresh and modernize our brand, expand distribution, and simplify our operating model. The earlier-than-planned laun…", "a": "Daniel Heaf, chief executive officer of Bath & Body Works, commented", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/701985/000070198526000005/ex991bbwi-20254qearningsre.htm"}, {"d": "2025-11-20", "n": 5.56, "z": -0.11, "rz": 1.4, "earn": true, "q": "Today, we are excited to announce a comprehensive transformation plan to revitalize Bath & Body Works across brand, product, and marketplace. This plan, the Consumer First Formula, focuses our investments in our four largest revenue driving opportunities - creating disruptive and innovative product, reigniting our bran…", "a": "Daniel Heaf, chief executive officer of Bath & Body Works, commented", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/701985/000070198525000033/ex991bbwi-20253qearningsre.htm"}, {"d": "2025-05-29", "n": 6.67, "z": 0.52, "rz": 0.69, "earn": true, "q": "Our team delivered a strong start to the year driven by the positive customer response to our innovation in the quarter. We're effectively leveraging our predominantly U.S.-based supply chain to navigate the evolving trade environment, and I’m confident in our ability to adapt to meet the consumer where they are with f…", "a": "said Eva Boratto, CFO, Bath & Body Works", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/701985/000070198525000018/ex991bbwi-20251qearningsre.htm"}], "now": {"d": "2026-11-19", "z": -0.14, "mood": "usual"}, "say_do": {"mood": "usual", "acts": "sell", "clash": false, "agree": false}}, "score": {"value": 48, "verdict": {"it": "Nessuna convinzione chiara", "en": "No clear conviction"}, "confidence": "Media", "covered_pct": 80, "missing": ["guid"], "subs": [{"id": "insider", "name": {"it": "Insider", "en": "Insiders"}, "w": 35, "v": 50, "why": [{"it": "Nessun acquisto discrezionale negli ultimi 90 giorni.", "en": "No discretionary purchase in the last 90 days."}, {"it": "Flusso netto pesato sullo storico: -0.00 M$.", "en": "Net flow weighted by 